 "body": "<p>There are <code>N</code> houses in a straight line, numbered 1 to N. Exactly <code>K</code> of them celebrate a festival; their house numbers are given in no particular order.</p><p>A resident of every non-celebrating house walks to the nearest celebrating house. The distance between houses <code>i</code> and <code>j</code> is <code>|i − j|</code>.</p><p>Print the largest distance any resident has to walk. If every house celebrates, print <code>0</code>.</p><h3>Function to complete</h3><p>Complete <code>maxDistance(n, houses)</code>. It returns the maximum walking distance.</p><p class=\"muted\">Input reading and printing are handled for you, like on LeetCode. The input format below is what the tests and <i>Custom input</i> use.</p>",
